# AGENTS.md

Conventions for agents working in this repo.

## Commands

- Install: `<install command>`
- Build: `<build command>`
- Test: `<test command>`
- Lint: `<lint command>`
- Run one test: `<pattern>`

## Style

- `<language>`: `<formatter/linter>` (settings in `<config file>`).
- Commits: Conventional Commits (`feat:`, `fix:`, `chore:`, ...).
- PRs: title = commit subject; body = what + why + verification.

